  "description": "Thread-safe collection variants for .NET 8: a lock-free Vyukov MPMC ConcurrentCircularBuffer<T>, a lock-free split-ordered ConcurrentHashSet<T>, and a lock-striped ConcurrentEvictingDictionary<TKey,TValue> bounded cache (FIFO/LRU/LFU/MRU/SecondChance/Random policies, optional TTL expiry). Split out of Bodu.Collections with namespaces unchanged; references Bodu.Collections.",
